# Best Practices

* Use meaningful playbook names.
* Always perform a syntax check before execution.
* Use inventory groups instead of individual IPs.
* Store sensitive information in Ansible Vault.
* Use roles for reusable configurations.
* Use tags to run specific tasks.
* Keep playbooks modular and readable.
* Maintain all playbooks in GitHub for version control.

## Verification Commands

```bash
ansible --version
ansible all -m ping
ansible-inventory --list
ansible-playbook --syntax-check playbook.yml
```

These commands help verify that your Ansible environment and playbooks are working correctly.
